---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Last updated: November 16, 2025</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">We collect information you provide directly to us, including:</p>
        <ul class="text-gray-700">
          <li>Account information (name, email, company)</li>
          <li>CRM data accessed through authorized integrations</li>
          <li>Usage data and analytics</li>
          <li>Communication preferences</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">2. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul class="text-gray-700">
          <li>Provide and improve our services</li>
          <li>Send CRM alerts and notifications</li>
          <li>Analyze usage patterns</li>
          <li>Communicate with you about the service</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">3. Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data. All data is encrypted in transit and at rest.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">We integrate with Salesforce, HubSpot, Slack, and Microsoft Teams with your explicit authorization.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. Contact us at privacy@pyko.com.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">6. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">For privacy questions, contact us at privacy@pyko.com.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
